#: scenario:scenario_63B01B20_FFDA_4105_BCEF_4F9911C0B725
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29a183b0c32b9091cc05d64356aeb377316967968349ebbe302e088cbddf018f
#. default-sha256: d1b0647436bdbbdf3fda508c303b9595ee783572e6bb9c3b92771f326fb130a2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_63B01B20_FFDA_4105_BCEF_4F9911C0B725"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫“The mansion had an alluring air of beauty about it in that era;⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫it was "
"almost like something out of a fairy tale.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫À⟪k:38⟫ cette époque, le manoir dégageait une sorte de charme "
"irrésistible ;⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫il ressemblait presque à une maison tout droit sortie d’un conte "
"de fées."

#: scenario:scenario_D8C620F4_AD25_48DF_A912_D788A4C578D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65aad33102c7769a2e10839f2891df37067fb7e6c37bad3942852bf7aef8630c
#. default-sha256: 1e75a74baeabf6dd6cb09df47f9ef2a38530e7e7d078caf5ff134ec86f39f583
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D8C620F4_AD25_48DF_A912_D788A4C578D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This period of history could perhaps be described as a symphony of destruction, as "
"cumbersome principles of old came crashing down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Cette période de l’histoire était une véritable ode au changement, alors que les lourds "
"principes du passé venaient à s’effondrer."

#: scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6db44924e94c823cc4756e1b071aba5ab2cde971064d8d6e0486571fb6eb7237
#. default-sha256: c101b1e775cb530626e0a432130519f638b4cdd3d8ebd69163fa7600f547edc3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Freed from the day-to-day oppression of these antiquated precepts, the people seemed to hark "
"back to the more poetic, expressive ways of old."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les gens, libérés de l’oppression quotidienne que formaient ces antiques préceptes, "
"semblaient revenir vers les usages plus expressifs et poétiques d’antan."

#: scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13ed391bd5f9fb47475808b753b553df3ecf5d220430405155cc530c543fe0d8
#. default-sha256: 18f5ee0229e1e5f4974566af808378aecb52a70175bb4e51c18389a552e4bfe8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They took these newly blossoming emotions in hand, and with them they wrote literature, "
"painted portraits, composed theatre, and found love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ils redonnèrent la part belle aux émotions et grâce à elles, ils écrivirent de la "
"littérature, peignirent des portraits, composèrent des pièces de théâtre et trouvèrent l’amour."

#: scenario:scenario_CB4AB513_EC78_4644_B255_F6EB0C71B215
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddbd64622e30b813eb7758f009b7baa9c64a3c644569b5d2e44238d34a5eba5d
#. default-sha256: cac52ea5988672484edb5540743638805695e87b43303a23bdd0e6cb1679dd46
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CB4AB513_EC78_4644_B255_F6EB0C71B215"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the Church, which had maintained authority throughout the Middle Ages, embraced the "
"changing times, adopting the culture’s flowering sense of aesthetic."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Même l’⟪k:1⟫É⟪k:2⟫glise, qui avait maintenu son autorité tout au long du Moyen ⟪k:3⟫Â⟪k:4⟫"
"ge, embrassait ces bouleversements et s’ouvrait à cette culture. L’esthétique fleurissait."

#: scenario:scenario_E2D63C37_8B1E_4480_9979_811ED8FC0CC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56b551875d3a7332e26e7f9496c81aaf9866beb1550e433a52d2eb38fca57ea1
#. default-sha256: 23af861a95191c4dbd1efd9e1de4f30862c8197d2a67b97b68d9ddecf1968ea3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E2D63C37_8B1E_4480_9979_811ED8FC0CC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫War would break out not twenty years from then, plucking the ripened era from the tree of "
"history—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but that is of no concern to us now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La guerre n’éclaterait que dans une vingtaine d’années, cueillant le fruit mûr de l’arbre de "
"l’histoire—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ mais cela ne nous concerne pas pour le moment."

#: scenario:scenario_FBF23873_677B_4F7E_90CB_56B4F9DEFC6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 539e7cdbc56bb1b7586e94606a1ebc5708fec074c7d51e17d266a385a4a62dc2
#. default-sha256: 24ebff2409c68789c819bd4b98c32d9b2a8d6168ae808b7515c98f034c27ff11
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FBF23873_677B_4F7E_90CB_56B4F9DEFC6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, it was still what people refer to as the Golden Age, a period of furor for all "
"who were there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ l’époque, on était encore dans ce que les gens appellent l’⟪k:3⟫Â⟪k:4⟫ge d’Or, "
"un tourbillon de folie pour les contemporains."

#: scenario:scenario_709FB765_6076_4326_9B5F_D37FB6CAD9F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d72bfdb3bb3085f9cf8d64c4357d21e0563f60eba512d9866cdbf72db2cd7c1
#. default-sha256: f99f6f2fe29a8de3343cc77ee1e622d7c2cbf96631920542b24e370b60dec5c0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_709FB765_6076_4326_9B5F_D37FB6CAD9F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Now, let us take a slight detour."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫À⟪k:10⟫ présent, faisons un léger détour."

#: scenario:scenario_BE59C5FE_F4DC_421A_9E7A_430A70556DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a50ef1a2121c0b8cbf8c93f56923a729c982d78db0e7e753125294afae8d935e
#. default-sha256: d3c861dcdd1ba1334c38daf7859f993f3143e1c4461ca5ff25340b9d8b6af8a8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE59C5FE_F4DC_421A_9E7A_430A70556DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, we will not be changing locations—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫this is a tale about the mansion, from "
"beginning to end. ⟪k:3⟫We ⟪k:4⟫will⟪k:5⟫, however, be moving through time. ⟪k:6⟫Say... ⟪k:7⟫about "
"eight years into the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non, nous n’allons pas changer de lieu—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ c’est un conte sur le manoir, du début à "
"la fin. ⟪k:3⟫Mais nous allons remonter le temps. ⟪k:4⟫Disons jusqu’à... ⟪k:5⟫oui, environ huit "
"ans auparavant."

#: scenario:scenario_9E3FFB8B_EAD7_43D7_A427_8C7BCE912ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d56acabca13a6d77b9afd2a72c72d3688915309877d3f45ecd723a6635332b68
#. default-sha256: a09f8caac2576fd8d5ae195886079d8238061878f3daa470894471fb6678199c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9E3FFB8B_EAD7_43D7_A427_8C7BCE912ECA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A very wealthy family lived in the house then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Une famille très aisée vivait alors dans la maison."

#: scenario:scenario_1562B177_D703_447B_A77E_920C52C76F1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a09e3d62d58fbc633b0b6ef1a2e516cd36e8c31f8bb0450f68cd07c4f8e5c74c
#. default-sha256: ce69ee65355dc136cc471c008285f4404566eb7e661d80054dd9211e3109c203
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1562B177_D703_447B_A77E_920C52C76F1E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mother and father, brother and sister all had distinctive, beautiful flaxen hair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La mère, le père, le frère et la sœur avaient tous de beaux cheveux blonds reconnaissables "
"entre mille."

#: scenario:scenario_20130EE8_E62A_48C8_AA1C_B8FAE8B6709E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 276ea7a2669a0e43dce3309bb094c553508ac1d3f1d640b521e7c7c09e58bfe8
#. default-sha256: 2f39ecbacfd739460fb4ddcd2ee80ca2bbd173ba854a4018645a87fdec03fc29
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20130EE8_E62A_48C8_AA1C_B8FAE8B6709E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was always enamored by their hair.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫By contrast, mine is the color of a wet crow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’ai toujours adoré leurs cheveux.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Par contraste, les miens ont la couleur d’un "
"corbeau mouillé."

#: scenario:scenario_C31CB050_5A68_4BE8_82E7_B6AB10BCE924
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d3e8c54a4b0964fbfd279e8d41ea2d572148e9651044fed388bac03ade00c62
#. default-sha256: 7c059da3f52b8215d6166d022a51d321303e02a2760f040bdabb794684a2b68a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C31CB050_5A68_4BE8_82E7_B6AB10BCE924"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See? There I am, standing around, looking rather a fool."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vous voyez ? Je me tiens à côté d’eux et j’ai l’air d’une idiote."

#: scenario:scenario_E938425F_E243_4D5B_91A5_736A9F4D674B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d7184a6dd378813abf5011939e2472bd7fa548f8cec7f0215f45d83ec9d441e
#. default-sha256: af1563075f98eb39f6d724ffe02cb67f8fffb07a1d34f131949797c425c8e4a7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E938425F_E243_4D5B_91A5_736A9F4D674B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was happy back then. ⟪k:1⟫And what reason did I have not to be, afforded the opportunity "
"to attend to such a beautiful home?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’étais heureuse à l’époque. ⟪k:1⟫Et comment ne l’aurais-je pas été, alors qu’on m’offrait "
"la chance de m’occuper d’une si belle maison ?"

#: scenario:scenario_3C0ADA2C_7EE6_4AD3_855F_93B525DFB7DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67bace4d1a5fd216182839423f9278f141139305b0c9b8ea6cfbe25e1152c276
#. default-sha256: 0c49763ee7254aeaf8714cbcf64ed4cca77c4381a78e28185810d35f41a7df1c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C0ADA2C_7EE6_4AD3_855F_93B525DFB7DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I poured my heart into serving that family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est pourquoi je servais cette famille de tout mon cœur."

#: scenario:scenario_BB69FD67_0E0B_4E42_A52D_C46BE2D4A149
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b54b75b62c281a5f199cdb2ee08880dec9625c7aa15d44c35f9549af7b1bc1f
#. default-sha256: c4dec5cd8c0628101cefae9961484348333cd564129f9248d73423fe2e368ff0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BB69FD67_0E0B_4E42_A52D_C46BE2D4A149"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Listen closely, if you would. ⟪k:1⟫That soft, fleeting sound that could only be a young "
"girl singing—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫can you hear it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...⟪k:1⟫É⟪k:2⟫coutez attentivement, s’il vous plaît. ⟪k:3⟫Ce bruit doux et fugace qui ne "
"peut être que celui d’une jeune fille qui chante—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ l’entendez-vous ?"

#: scenario:scenario_17D4D6FE_C596_4A24_83F8_5EA3C565E1E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7467998e27d10070241ffd4b2ec71c5c0775da263ad6973f1cca659d16bc4537
#. default-sha256: fb8ee8855502daa9c2724f75d129000893665a3ed53380bd1165a01173c86bb4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_17D4D6FE_C596_4A24_83F8_5EA3C565E1E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lalalaa, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lalaalalaa..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lalalaa, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lalaalalaa..."

#: scenario:scenario_BCAEF6C0_53CC_4049_865E_85DAAB53B84D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dc731cb97ad558178dbdb39043b38426ec707f2f9dfa5fe47937534c669b7be
#. default-sha256: 32dd364800020434f03804d73dccc58398b8cb4355c440b7084ed3ae61ce82fe
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BCAEF6C0_53CC_4049_865E_85DAAB53B84D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl you see, cheerfully picking crimson roses and singing like a songbird, was called "
"Nellie."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La fille que vous voyez, qui cueille gaiement des roses écarlates et qui chante comme un "
"rossignol, s’appelait Nellie."

#: scenario:scenario_E7A5DDF4_1895_4A80_A519_9B2F5069A053
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bca3b86b9295ae2090c2f2e6ad8ff30b7728c9f4f5ef31b5d29770ede22167c
#. default-sha256: a20035de926ff87f34aba5134739cdedf9f8ad1f7a30b8dcb3e1c5a35a3022a4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E7A5DDF4_1895_4A80_A519_9B2F5069A053"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though young, she sang with elegance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Malgré sa jeunesse, elle chantait avec grâce."

#: scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D080
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad2584e8e1ca3f68a466897e8b4a5aabb48a9a2b53a249e42c65b1046ac5ce62
#. default-sha256: b297b9ae697bb9b2f0983c11f3429d39e8f603323e4f892d26c9241a005f69c7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D080"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was deeply fond of the house’s garden, and she would often spend her afternoons there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nellie adorait le jardin, et elle y passait souvent ses après-midis."

#: scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D079
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e048681dc14c89365541b14986f41c04253fa1efc8593ab876375d550975f198
#. default-sha256: 38e19573ca383c12d5574069d3dac07d83172a7176fe5b468266bcd73cf0aaa0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D079"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gorgeous roses gathered from all across the world bloomed in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫De superbes roses venues du monde entier l’embellissaient."

#: scenario:scenario_EC6C57EC_D4F8_4A1F_B30C_E07EB8B58D40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0455d67b9a2e87204c5224892a29eaba8c8a903895863dc9926d2c1570b7626e
#. default-sha256: 9ea4f83db4e0d8e952ae28d0f28f55358783173c205322e1d365a895701176d9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EC6C57EC_D4F8_4A1F_B30C_E07EB8B58D40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were given the utmost care, and even had their thorns removed—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫On y consacrait le plus grand soin et on leur enlevait même leurs épines—"

#: scenario:scenario_EAA05CB3_88C5_42E0_84F0_D2378A066978
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8db042a5320795b795804d0b3bed589f22efaa5ba125c3c33f421ba465b1f5d5
#. default-sha256: 62b1d284c229edddc7f5bd1723e5927ab9be2cde8fd8d6471897700c28211ef3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EAA05CB3_88C5_42E0_84F0_D2378A066978"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so young Nellie would not hurt herself, naturally."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫pour que la jeune Nellie ne se blesse pas avec, naturellement."

#: scenario:scenario_9AD3568A_CE83_4EC9_931B_09C984521DFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14ecce8c8b520cb845e9196feb5a16ce7bcc9624cf8415575caff6662e42b971
#. default-sha256: c88ed1db8eabab8d121cb3b6bbf73162e5e1a9a7523e7abceee32c918eaf465b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9AD3568A_CE83_4EC9_931B_09C984521DFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The light-brown-haired girl carefully plucked petals from the roses, gathering them up as "
"she sang."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La fille aux cheveux châtains clairs effeuillait précautionneusement les pétales de roses et "
"les rassemblait tout en chantant."

#: scenario:scenario_06BC61C6_E389_43D4_8C67_096FB58E00E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
