#: scenario:scenario_CD482BA8_A73A_4792_99CF_38E3C49F8D14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57825f11e74c7a95e0f3d0d433cfb1b2f5246e3ce40cb186185140faf4f675ed
