msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD482BA8_A73A_4792_99CF_38E3C49F8D14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was, as a matter of fact, not the only visitor to the rose garden that day. ⟪k:1⟫She "
"always came with her older brother, Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il se trouve que Nellie n’était pas toute seule dans le jardin ce jour-là. ⟪k:1⟫Elle venait "
"toujours accompagnée de son frère aîné, Mell."

#: scenario:scenario_7A9E35EF_61A0_4E46_A820_3FB9C3BD4276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08df4452ae218d7a86b16007653bcc35e2cc22f2035a0ded6d7a32481ef0754d
#. default-sha256: cae39914a63452674135287c34be234081f45130cdcb2bf9442e274b19ac8ffa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7A9E35EF_61A0_4E46_A820_3FB9C3BD4276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The young siblings were inseparable. ⟪k:1⟫Mell adored his little sister, who in turn pined "
"for his attention."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les deux jeunes gens étaient inséparables. ⟪k:1⟫Mell adorait sa petite sœur qui, en retour, "
"faisait tout pour attirer son attention."

#: scenario:scenario_6297F308_1089_41ED_B599_88622EEB5CFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2283fb2925c6516518fe9adb4e53460cdaab4b383ca25b407a514947a15134e3
#. default-sha256: 3d4b82b4c9f47cd1cf18e839acbfba7dfcb659b1cd8dd253b5ac20bb5fe03a9e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6297F308_1089_41ED_B599_88622EEB5CFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of the two innocent children cuddling together—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫not yet shackled by fear "
"for the future—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was truly heartwarming."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était vraiment réconfortant de voir ces deux enfants innocents prendre soin l’un de l’autre"
"—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ sans se préoccuper⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ du futur."

#: scenario:scenario_48D24DEF_2DA4_4798_9B13_66395CFC917D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8584169c1df66f695973a9a05e072a9c2668742535c27ed753beb11269d93b21
#. default-sha256: 8547980196032ec23eafa801bc503b63a00beaa35ce5ebfc22a63411ffc112af
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_48D24DEF_2DA4_4798_9B13_66395CFC917D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That day, Mell was sitting in the shade of a tree reading a book. ⟪k:1⟫As I am sure you are "
"aware, in their time, books could not yet be mass produced."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce jour-là, Mell était assis à l’ombre d’un arbre et lisait un livre. ⟪k:1⟫Comme vous le "
"savez certainement, les livres, à cette époque, n’étaient pas encore produits en masse."

#: scenario:scenario_5FA5021E_D160_466F_8EB1_C05FDA1A31C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9ceb58f7f2ca9bf196de19d17889cdc6ba200fd3256a5cdcbd26d770a74ccc0
#. default-sha256: 94415581a0757c422f451682c4d90fe474fe6270b312f85b8587db625951e67b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5FA5021E_D160_466F_8EB1_C05FDA1A31C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What he was reading had been copied by a scribe.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I presume he had borrowed it from "
"the church."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce qu’il lisait avait été copié par un scribe.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’imagine qu’il l’avait emprunté à "
"l’église."

#: scenario:scenario_2D9E3BC0_0854_4F34_ABE7_A93B23D50558
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50cba4e815efd6aad97c0e7e6207b17934cb360500ca02983bd458ad6e0002cd
#. default-sha256: b0da9382cee3d7416fc98180f6f860272177106477bca8fb17b7e19bfb748a81
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2D9E3BC0_0854_4F34_ABE7_A93B23D50558"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The book, having passed through many hands over many years, was visibly worn—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but I "
"suppose that just speaks to its importance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le livre était visiblement abîmé après être passé entre de si nombreuses mains au fil des "
"années—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ mais je suppose que cela ne faisait que renforcer son importance."

#: scenario:scenario_7F307564_3320_4CED_BC5E_3668C2A6DAEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66a7608642fb2c1020967dadf5c73167fd3cb73fafd006d667d6dc076d57a569
