msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was, in fact, a Latin grammar textbook he was reading."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce qu’il lisait était en fait un manuel de grammaire latine."

#: scenario:scenario_F4B1DED2_F3CD_4A8D_8D86_709E45A055FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d13b079143f2aeabb36bdb454fee3d6f729a2962cadc108ecd3c634de20a1da
