msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell was a clever boy. ⟪k:1⟫He had attended church from a very young age, where a priest "
"would instruct him in Latin grammar."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell était un garçon intelligent. ⟪k:1⟫Il allait à l’église depuis tout petit et le prêtre "
"lui enseignait le latin."

#: scenario:scenario_4B1407FC_77A8_4A4B_995D_9B1FDDB3075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16b2ed22c843c4f18741149fe3a87f845b805abc67526e271221b0ee5c1300f7
